# A diagnostic about code inside a template interpolation must point at the
# line and column in the FILE. The parser used to lex each `${...}` body as a
# standalone string, so this reported `bad.yo:1:1` and printed the body text
# alone as the source line
# (issues/fixed/template-interpolation-body-is-not-scanned-as-code.md).
stdout_keep_match=(error\[E0401\][^.]*\.|--> bad\.yo:[0-9]+:[0-9]+)
